            <ArticleTitle>Coronary artery ectasia--a case report and literature review.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>415-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case report of coronary artery ectasia is presented. A middle-aged man was admitted with sudden onset of respiratory arrest which is a rather rare occurrence. Relevant articles are reviewed, and discussion mainly concerns the etiologic and pathophysiologic point of view.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
